# Business Management System

A modern full-stack Business Management System built to manage business operations efficiently with a clean UI, secure backend, and scalable architecture.

## 🚀 Project Overview

This project is designed to help businesses manage daily operations digitally.
It includes frontend and backend integration with authentication, management modules, APIs, and responsive UI.

The system focuses on:

* Business workflow management
* User authentication & authorization
* Data handling & API integration
* Responsive dashboard interface
* Secure backend operations
* Scalable architecture

---

# 🛠️ Tech Stack

## Frontend

* React.js
* Vite
* Tailwind CSS
* Daisy UI
* Redux Toolkit
* React Router DOM
* Axios

## Backend

* Node.js
* Express.js
* MongoDB
* Mongoose
* JWT Authentication

---

